From 8ee0dfbe0513bc5724216c094999279cb06829c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Javier Maestro <jjmaestro@ieee.org>
Date: Sun, 3 May 2026 08:51:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] patch: export LD_LIBRARY_PATH from the toolchain sysroot for
 built tools

RFCC's bootstrap tools (BootstrapGNUMake, BootstrapPkgConfig, BootstrapNinja,
BootstrapMeson) are autoconf-driven: `./configure` compiles a tiny `conftest`
binary and then EXECUTES it ("checking whether we are cross compiling..."). The
compiled `conftest` inherits its env from configure; under Bazel's hermetic
Linux sandbox with a custom sysroot, that env has no `LD_LIBRARY_PATH`, the
chroot has no `/lib/<multiarch>/`, and the binary's NEEDED `libm.so.6` /
`libc.so.6` / etc. fail to resolve at exec time:

  ./conftest: error while loading shared libraries: libm.so.6:
  cannot open shared object file: No such file or directory

cc_wrapper.sh's `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` export covers clang's own NEEDED libs
(libLLVM-14.so.1, libclang-cpp.so.14) but only applies to clang's process
tree, not to sibling subprocesses that `configure` later spawns. The fix
must live at the action level so `configure` inherits the env and propagates
it to `./conftest`, `./build.sh`, the just-built `make`, etc.

Inject `export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=...` at the top of the script that
`built_tool_rule_impl` generates for every bootstrap tool, derived from the
cc_toolchain's `sysroot` attr and the target arch's multiarch lib dir. Uses
the `$$EXT_BUILD_ROOT$$` placeholder that `convert_shell_script` already
expands to `$EXT_BUILD_ROOT` (the action's CWD).

The export is a no-op when the sysroot is empty or the target cpu isn't
recognized, so non-Linux / non-sysroot consumers are unaffected.

Anchored against rules_foreign_cc commit
006ae82d9b4953a9b1c170827aef660f9f0f9ec0 (the project's pinned RFCC,
post-0.15.1). The file lives at
`foreign_cc/built_tools/private/built_tools_framework.bzl`.
---
 foreign_cc/built_tools/private/built_tools_framework.bzl | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/foreign_cc/built_tools/private/built_tools_framework.bzl b/foreign_cc/built_tools/private/built_tools_framework.bzl
index d17e624..9e66839 100644
--- a/foreign_cc/built_tools/private/built_tools_framework.bzl
+++ b/foreign_cc/built_tools/private/built_tools_framework.bzl
@@ -108,8 +108,13 @@ def built_tool_rule_impl(ctx, script_lines, out_dir, mnemonic, additional_tools
 
     cc_toolchain = find_cpp_toolchain(ctx)
 
+    _sr = cc_toolchain.sysroot
+    _multiarch = {"k8": "x86_64-linux-gnu", "aarch64": "aarch64-linux-gnu"}.get(cc_toolchain.cpu, "")
+    _ld_export = ("export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=\"$$EXT_BUILD_ROOT$$/{0}/lib/{1}:$$EXT_BUILD_ROOT$$/{0}/usr/lib/{1}\"").format(_sr, _multiarch) if _sr and _multiarch else ""
+
     script = [
         "##script_prelude##",
+        _ld_export,
     ] + env_prelude + [
         "##rm_rf## $$INSTALLDIR$$",
         "##rm_rf## $$BUILD_TMPDIR$$",
